 "remarks": "The Pinnacle of Village Sophistication: The Penthouse at The Quartier. At the heart of downtown New Canaan, The Quartier reimagines timeless luxury through 21 bespoke residences that harmonize classic architecture with forward-thinking sustainability, including solar energy and Geo-thermal. This premier 2,500-square-foot Penthouse offers an unrivaled sense of privacy with a private elevator serving all levels, leading to a sprawling terrace where floor-to-ceiling glass doors and oversized windows frame stunning town views. Inside, the open-concept layout is defined by soaring cathedral ceilings, 7\" white oak flooring, a gas fireplace and a gourmet chef's kitchen featuring sleek Leicht cabinetry, quartzite counters and Watermark fixtures, while the primary suite serves as a spa-like retreat with a glamorous bath and generous walk-in closet. Residents benefit from a sophisticated, white-glove lifestyle, including a full-time concierge, professional fitness studio, golf simulator, and an outdoor firepit lounge - all located steps from elite dining, boutique shopping, and the NYC train.",
